#: ../../language/error_codes/E0030.md:1
msgid "E0030"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0030.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `missing_package_alias`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0030.md:5
msgid ""
"The package alias is empty. The default package alias will be used instead. "
"This warning applies to the legacy `moon.pkg.json` format. Current `moon` "
"commands reject JSON manifests, and `moon.pkg` cannot express an explicitly "
"empty alias. The examples below are retained as migration references."
msgstr ""
"パッケージの別名が空のため、デフォルトの別名が使用されます。この警告は旧形式の `moon.pkg.json` に適用されます。現在の `moon` "
"コマンドは JSON 設定ファイルを受け付けず、`moon.pkg` では明示的に空の別名を記述できません。以下の例は移行時の参考として残しています。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0030.md:10
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0030.md:12
#: ../../language/error_codes/E0030.md:21
msgid "moon.pkg.json"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0030.md:12
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"import\": [\n"
"    {\n"
"      \"path\": \"moonbit-community/E0030/lib\",\n"
"      \"alias\": \"\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0030.md:17
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0030.md:19
msgid "Use a non-empty alias for the package:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0030.md:21
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"import\": [\n"
"    {\n"
"      \"path\": \"moonbit-community/E0030-fixed/lib\",\n"
"      \"alias\": \"hello\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
